## Key Concepts
- Real-time two-stage Hybrid detector; - Differentiable rule engine for regulatory constraints; - Federated learning with DP and secure aggregation; - Online drift detectors (ADWIN/DDM); - Per-transaction explainability with rule-paths.

## Code Example
```javascript
function score(tx, features, rules) {
  const base = detectorScore(features);
  const ruleScore = applyDifferentiableRules(features, rules);
  return sigmoid(base + ruleScore);
}
```

